  "adaptations_phase18": [
    "Arc formatter handle retains identity; concrete Clone deep-copies palette but retains stack references. get_style_stack returns a shared stack handle with the same visible mutations.",
    "Trait formatting accepts Option<&str> and returns Result<Option<String>>; concrete format_optional handles optional input because Rust does not overload inherent methods.",
    "as_wrappable exposes the second trait through type erasure without unsafe casting; actual custom implementation tested.",
    "Ordering uses already locked parking_lot 0.12.5 ReentrantMutex; short data locks are released before user apply/clone/drop callbacks. No asynchronous work occurs in the formatter.",
    "Explicit runtime formatter replacement preserves its own decoration instead of restoring flags belonging to an obsolete formatter object. Existing non-replaced nested/cancel scopes retain restoration."
  ],
  "related_public_types": "color-terminal-contracts.json"
}
